occurrences.label:
  caption: "A new edition of the Holy Lord Phoenix IV's verses on he himself: 

"When the darkness befell mankind, our Benefactor sent us a guide; 
He created the Phoenix from his own essence. 
The Phoenix is not merely a man with a common soul;
The Phoenix is an extension of the Lord. 
His soul is divinely pure, it cannot be corrupt; 
The Phoenix must always be the one guiding the wavering flames.
No other can receive our Creator's instructions.""

